headline AS headline, e.at AS at, e.direction AS direction, collect(d.id) AS nodes ORDER BY at DESC LIMIT $limit", "params": {"nodes": ["Oil_Supply"], "since": 1789662442, "limit": 5}, "rows": 1, "ms": 1.93}]}, {"type": "tool_call", "name": "record_alert", "input": {"headline": "OPEC+ agrees deeper oil production cuts through next year", "sources": ["Oil_Supply"], "direction": -1, "summary": "Lower oil supply strongly lifts oil prices (immediate), benefiting producers (OXY, COP, EOG, XOM); airlines hurt moderately within ~1 month; inflation -> interest rates -> homebuilders weakly over ~7 months. Compounds earlier OPEC+ 2m bpd surprise cut.", "tickers": ["OXY", "COP", "EOG", "XOM", "CVX", "BRENT"]}}, {"type": "tool_result", "name": "record_alert", "error": false, "result": {"event_id": "evt_82e2f67f12", "alert_id": "alr_7377c49760"}, "queries": [{"name": "RESOLVE_EXACT", "cypher": "MATCH (d:Driver) WHERE d.id IN $ids RETURN d.id AS id, d.name AS name, d.theme AS theme", "params": {"ids": ["Oil_Supply"]}, "rows": 1, "ms": 1.06}, {"name": "RECORD_EVENT", "cypher": "CREATE (e:Event {id: $id, headline: $headline, at: $at, direction: $direction, url: $url}) WITH e UNWIND $nodes AS nid MATCH (d:Driver {id: nid}) CREATE (e)-[:HIT]->(d) RETURN e.id AS id", "params": {"id": "evt_82e2f67f12", "headline": "OPEC+ agrees deeper oil production cuts through next year", "at": 1792254449, "direction": -1, "url": "", "nodes": ["Oil_Supply"]}, "rows": 1, "ms": 0.62}, {"name": "CREATE_ALERT", "cypher": "MATCH (e:Event {id: $event_id}) CREATE (al:Alert {id: $id, text: $text, at: $at, answer_type: $answer_type})-[:FROM]->(e) WITH al UNWIND $tickers AS t MATCH (a:Asset {ticker: t}) CREATE (al)-[:FLAGS]->(a) RETURN al.id AS id", "params": {"id": "alr_7377c49760", "event_id": "evt_82e2f67f12", "text": "Lower oil supply strongly lifts oil prices (immediate), benefiting producers (OXY, COP, EOG, XOM); airlines hurt moderately within ~1 month; inflation -> interest rates -> homebuilders weakly over ~7 months. Compounds earlier OPEC+ 2m bpd surprise cut.", "at": 1792254449, "answer_type": "answered", "tickers": ["OXY", "COP", "EOG", "XOM", "CVX", "BRENT"]}, "rows": 6, "ms": 0.5}]}, {"type": "brief", "answer_type": "compounding", "text": "Less oil coming to market should push oil prices clearly higher right away, helping oil producers and hurting fuel-hungry businesses like airlines.\n\nThe surprising effect is on home buying: oil prices rise, then overall prices rise, then interest rates go up, then homebuilders slow down. That link is weak and would take about 7 months to show. Producers such as OXY, COP, EOG, XOM and CVX stand to gain almost immediately as Brent crude climbs, while airlines feel the squeeze within about a month. This adds to OPEC+'s earlier surprise cut of 2 million barrels a day.", "analysis": {"sources": ["Oil_Supply"], "direction": -1, "depth": 4, "drivers": [{"id": "Oil_Supply", "impact": 1.0, "direction": -1, "hops": 0, "lag_months": 0, "path": ["Oil_Supply"]}, {"id": "Oil_Price", "impact": 0.81, "direction": 1, "hops": 1, "lag_months": 0, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price"]}, {"id": "Oil_and_Gas", "impact": 0.62, "direction": 1, "hops": 2, "lag_months": 0, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price", "Oil_and_Gas"]}, {"id": "Airlines", "impact": 0.534, "direction": -1, "hops": 2, "lag_months": 1, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price", "Airlines"]}, {"id": "Inflation", "impact": 0.413, "direction": 1, "hops": 2, "lag_months": 1, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price", "Inflation"]}, {"id": "Consumer_Spending", "impact": 0.383, "direction": -1, "hops": 2, "lag_months": 2, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price", "Consumer_Spending"]}, {"id": "LNG_and_Gas_Export", "impact": 0.347, "direction": 1, "hops": 3, "lag_months": 3, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price", "Oil_and_Gas", "LNG_and_Gas_Export"]}, {"id": "Interest_Rates", "impact": 0.281, "direction": 1, "hops": 3, "lag_months": 4, "path": ["Oil_Supply", "Oil_Price", "Inflation", "Interest_Rates"]}, {"id